   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Figurative language",
     "texto": [
      "**Personification** gives an object or phenomenon a human action: **angin malam berbisik** (\"the night wind whispers\"). It is not interpreted literally.",
      "**Irony** can express criticism through words that seem to praise; the context reveals the intention. In English, as in Indonesian, translating only the words can hide the tone or the criticism."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
